        (Macaulay2Doc)String,, default value "ByFacets",
  * Outputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, L = list of (affine) linear forms
        cutting out codimension one faces specified by E, raised to the power
        (r+1)

Description
===========

This method returns a list of (affine) linear forms cutting out codimension one
faces, raised to the power (r+1).

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : V = {{0,0},{1,0},{1,1},{0,1}};                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : E = {{0,1},{0,2},{0,3},{1,2},{2,3}};                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : formsList(V,E,0)                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = {t , t  - t , t , t  - t , t  - t }                                     |
|       1   0    1   0   0    2   1    2                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : S=QQ[x,y];--can specify the polynomial ring to use, and whether to      |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|homogenize                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : formsList(V,E,0,BaseRing=>S,Homogenize=>false)                          |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = {y, x - y, x, x - 1, y - 1}                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

